WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.894
Brian: Hey, Ricky. Are you ready for school to start again?

2
00:00:08.895 --> 00:00:16.833
Ricky: Yeah, I can’t

3
00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:21.116
wait. Hey, Veronica, how was your summer?

4
00:00:21.117 --> 00:00:25.759
Veronica: I had a lovely time in Italy, Richard.

5
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.641
Then we went to Spain.

6
00:00:28.642 --> 00:00:34.401
Ricky: Wow. That’s great.

7
00:00:34.402 --> 00:00:37.089
My dad was right. Brian:

8
00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:39.072
About what? Ricky:

9
00:00:39.073 --> 00:00:42.949
Everyone has forgotten about the rumor. Brian:

10
00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:54.333
Oh, about you and Kitty.

11
00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:57.383
Ricky: Bye-bye, Brian.

12
00:00:57.384 --> 00:01:00.301
Kitty! Katy! Wait up! Kitty:

13
00:01:00.302 --> 00:01:03.806
We’re busy, Ricky. Ricky:

14
00:01:03.807 --> 00:01:06.030
Where are you going? Katy:

15
00:01:06.031 --> 00:01:10.028
It’s a secret. Ricky:

16
00:01:10.029 --> 00:01:14.177
A secret? I won’t tell anyone.

17
00:01:14.178 --> 00:01:20.790
Kitty: Sorry, Ricky, but we can’t tell you.

